    "turn_text": "appreciate it we'll be playing golf as soon as this interview is over uh... all right so let's talk about some some more as serious stuff uh... and let's talk about uh... the the tax reform bill that became law over the last couple weeks so you in the rest of the democratic party uh... voted against it their their elements of this though and I'm I'm as you know John I'm an anti term conservative I'm curious what your your perspective is on on my take and my take of this is well I'm glad that taxes are being reduced but I'm wondering what happened to fiscal responsibility uh... what happened to you know reducing uh... forget about reducing the debt of the deficit uh... but it feels to me like a lot of this is effectively taking out a loan on our great-grandchildren or grandchildren at a fairly bad interest rate uh... all uh... in an effort to try to salvage what has been a disastrous uh... first year legislatively uh... what you what do you make of that take",
